#: modules/gui/qt/dialogs/firstrun/firstrunwizard.cpp:40
msgid "Welcome"
msgstr "Benvenguda"

#: modules/gui/qt/dialogs/firstrun/firstrunwizard.cpp:51
msgid ""
"<p>In order to protect your privacy, <i>VLC media player</i> does <b>not</b> "
"collect personal data or transmit them, not even in anonymized form, to "
"anyone.</p>\n"
"<p>Nevertheless, <i>VLC</i> is able to automatically retrieve information "
"about the media in your play queue from third party Internet-based services. "
"This includes cover art, track names, artist names and other meta-data.</p>\n"
"<p>Consequently, this may entail identifying some of your media files to "
"third party entities. Therefore the <i>VLC</i> developers require your "
"express consent for the media player to access the Internet automatically.</"
"p>\n"
msgstr ""
"<p>Per protegir vòstra vida privada, <i>lo lector multimèdia VLC</i> "
"<b>reculhís pas</b> ni transmet pas de donadas personalas, quitament pas en "
"forma anonimizada, a qual que siá.</p>\n"
"<p>Pasmens, <i>VLC</i> pòt recuperar automaticament d'informacions suls "
"mèdias de vòstra fila de lectura a partir de servicis tèrces basats sus "
"Internet. Aquò inclutz las jaquetas, los noms de pistas, los noms d'artistas "
"e d'autras metadonadas.</p>\n"
"<p>En consequéncia, aquò pòt menar a identificar d'unes de vòstres fichièrs "
"multimèdia a d'entitats tèrças. Es per aquò que los desvolopaires de <i>VLC</"
"i> demandan vòstre consentiment exprès per que lo lector multimèdia "
"accedisca automaticament a Internet.</p>\n"

#: modules/gui/qt/dialogs/firstrun/firstrunwizard.cpp:90
msgid ""
"<ul><li>No client-side decoration</li><li>Toolbar menu</li><li>Pinned video "
"controls</li></ul>"
msgstr ""
"<ul><li>Pas de decoracion costat client</li><li>Menú de la barra d'aisinas</"
"li><li>Contraròtles vidèo penjats</li></ul>"

